the delta value <math id="S2.F3.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> permuted at every token; the head is the median head of the median layer by the
value-to-key ratio. (b) Within-group max/RMS against group width, for groups along the key axis
(solid) and the value axis (dashed). (c) Ratio of the value-axis to
