<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A two-way additive decomposition of <math id="A3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\log|S|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\log|S|</annotation></semantics></math> within each head assigns more variance to the row
